        gateway error: discord slash final reply failed: MediaFetchError: Failed to fetch media from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openclaw/openclaw/main/docs/does-not-exist-609.png: HTTP 404 Not Found; body: 404: Not Found
plugin: followUps: []
        thrown: LocalMediaAccessError: Local media path is not under an allowed directory: <test home>/.repro-…/private.pdf. Use a file inside the agent workspace or another allowed media folder.
