| Before | Origin chat 12345 | Yes | One to 12345 | One |
| PR head | Origin chat 12345 | Yes | One to 12345 | None |
| PR head, different chat | Chat 12346 | Yes | One to 12346 and one to origin 12345 | None |

Each run waits eight seconds after the model emits its first final, reads Gateway history, and asserts the complete observed send list and notice count before shutdown. The traces retain all emitted model finals and all captured sends, including the baseline error notice. A missing or discarded model final fails the check.

